# The built page. One file, ~2.6 MB, almost all of it the two base64 blobs in
# src/data.js — and every byte of it is reproducible from src/ by
# `python3 build.py`, which tests/build_guard.py checks on every run. Keeping
# it here would add megabytes to the history per version and never be the
# thing anyone reads. CI builds it, publishes it to Pages and attaches it to
# the run.
dist/

# build.py keeps three generations of src/data.js and dist/nexus.html here
# before it overwrites either. They are a local undo, not project history.
.backups/

# tools/lint.py assembles src/app/*.js into one file here so eslint can see
# the program as the program. Regenerated on every run.
.lint/

node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

.DS_Store
